            <ArticleTitle>Litigation and post-traumatic TMD: how patients report treatment outcome.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>105-10</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Ongoing litigation may affect treatment response in patients with trauma-induced TMD. A survey of 100 patients underscores the need for comprehensive psychosocial and behavioral assessment, including evaluation of litigation status in these patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
